                  "An order of attachment may issue if it could issue out of the Supreme Court in a like case (grounds: NY:CPLR-6201-attachment-grounds), executed only within New York City (NY:CCA-801-provisional-city-only). No injunction, restraining order or restraining notice issues except for chattel recovery, prevention of waste, a CCA 1508 enforcement proceeding, or housing-standards enforcement; no receiver except in an enforcement proceeding, a mortgage foreclosure or an MDL 309(5) action.",
