                  "The landlord serves a summons on a former tenant in a Civil Court action.",
                  "Service follows Supreme Court practice (personal delivery, substituted service, affix-and-mail: NY:CPLR-308-natural-person; mail with acknowledgment: NY:CPLR-312-a-mail-service), but is made only within New York City unless another law authorizes service beyond the city. A tenant who has left the city is served outside it under CCA 404 on a claim arising from its possession of the NYC unit (NY:CCA-404-long-arm).",
